00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:37.990
SARAH NOVOTNY: Absolutely.

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:39.480
See, we're done.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.010
So I am Sarah Novotny.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:44.190
And as Mark said, I lead the
open source strategy group

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.510
for Google Cloud Platform.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:51.540
And I arrived here at Google
via a fairly circuitous route

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:55.140
of systems administration,
database administration,

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:58.045
and a number of websites,
open source projects

00:05:58.045 --> 00:05:58.920
that you've heard of.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:03.510
So Amazon, NGINX, a video gaming
